  booktitle={2024 IEEE Symposium on VLSI Technology and Circuits (VLSI Technology and Circuits)}, 
  title={Demonstration of On-Chip Switched-Capacitor DC-DC Converters using BEOL Compatible Oxide Power Transistors and Superlattice MIM Capacitors}, 
