  abstract={This paper presents a 5.4V-Vin, 0.6-1.8V Vout, 10MHz LDMOS-based buck IVR chiplet implemented in a 55nm BCD process featuring a self-timed bootstrap technique and same-cycle all-digital ZVS control to achieve 9.3A/mm2 current density and 93.6% peak conversion efficiency, while meeting all reliability constraints. The IVR chip supports a maximum load current of 80A and occupies 8.6mm2 die area.},
